title: From a wish to a reviewed chapter
kind: flow
dir: down
round want: "I want to learn Git"
box plan: plan the book
diamond ok: you approve?
box write: one writer writes\nthe whole chapter
box run: scripts run code,\npaste output, draw, check
box review: one review:\nrisk list, then one read
round read: you read and practise
want -> plan
plan -> ok
ok -> plan: change it
ok -> write: yes
write -> run
run -> review
review -> read
hot: run
